mland-atlas/minnesota/crow-wing-county"],["ARC or PLC in Crow Wing County","/arc-plc/minnesota/crow-wing-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 12 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 37 of 75 years. In 2025, the middle of the grids had October to November at 65% of normal and August to September at 67%. So far in 2026, April to May came in at 56% of normal on the middle of the grids. Every grid had its driest year in 1976, with grid 31343 at 47%.</p>"}
